# Response headers for Cloudflare Workers static assets.
# Vite copies this file from ./public into ./dist at build time; Workers parses
# it and never serves it. The noindex meta tag covers crawlers that render HTML
# — this covers everything else, which matters for an unsolicited concept.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
